Description: status client for the Ancilla platform
 Status client for the Ancilla platform (not the platform itself).
 Fetches and renders the current project status from ancilla.live.
 .
 The Ancilla platform is in active development; no platform code has
 been released yet. This is a small client that prints the live
 project status so people who hear about Ancilla can see where it is
 without checking the website.
 .
 Pre-release Ancilla code, when shared privately, is sandbox-only -
 never run with real personal data.
